  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 515,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 554,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 71088,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 60,
        "headingId": 554,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> typical histology combined with positive immunostaining for synaptophysin and chromogranin&nbsp;A.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T16:04:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 513,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 552,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 71089,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 60,
        "headingId": 552,
        "headingText": "<p >The Union for International Cancer Control (UICC) eighth-edition staging system is used.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2022-05-04T17:36:15"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 514,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 553,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 71090,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 60,
        "headingId": 553,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Regardless of location, these tumours have a dismal prognosis. The median survival time of bladder LCNEC is &lt;&nbsp;1&nbsp;year, and 3-year survival is just over 20% {32850401}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T16:04:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]